Hi Alex,

You can specify the shade values to be different for each day (e.g. if vegetation is changing through time) but the vectors 'minshades' and 'maxshades' need to be the same length as the number of days you're simulating. You made 'minshades' have length of 10, but instead you should put:

minshades <- rep(0, length(micro$MAXSHADES)) # min available shade?

All the best,
Mike

