Hi Julie,

It will simply be because the file names don't match - you do need to make them identical to the original names, with the addition of '_time' which is expected by the sub function 'ncquery'. That should solve your problem.

The 'years' is being set with the line:
years <- as.numeric(unique(format(tme, "%Y"))) and 'years[1]' is simply looking for the first element in that array. The 'sep' statement is an argument of the paste function that determines the separators between what is pasted.

All the best,
Mike

